  _senarioDescription: "You couldn't find anything out of the ordinary while investigating
    your home, yet you couldn't take your mind off of the topic. Trying to relax,
    you lay down in bed, shut your eyes, and start to drift asleep. As you are halfway
    out of consciousness, you feel something graze your leg\u2026 A hand, coming
    from under your bed, frozen with fear, you cannot move, and before you even notice,
    there is a knife at your throat, slicing it open, slowly taking your life. (Jumped
    the knife - Ending) "
